msgstr "尚未发现大图。打开“图片优化”并运行分析以填充此列表。"

#: includes/admin/trait-media.php:202 includes/admin/trait-media.php:606
msgid "Bulk optimization of existing images (recompressing originals and generating their WebP/AVIF copies) is not included in this plugin."
msgstr "本插件不包含对现有图片的批量优化（重新压缩原图并生成其 WebP/AVIF 副本）。"

#: includes/admin/trait-media.php:204
