#, php-format
msgid "Works: asked for a JPEG/PNG the way a browser does, the server answered with its %s copy."
msgstr "有效：像浏览器那样请求 JPEG/PNG 时，服务器返回了它的 %s 副本。"

#: includes/admin/trait-media.php:355
msgid "The server still answers with the original image. mod_rewrite may be off, or another rule answers first: ask your host, or use the <picture> serving."
msgstr "服务器仍然返回原始图片。可能 mod_rewrite 未启用，或其他规则先响应了：请咨询主机商，或使用 <picture> 方式提供。"

#: includes/admin/trait-media.php:357
msgid "The test image could not be requested from the server, so nothing could be checked."
msgstr "无法向服务器请求测试图片，因此无法进行任何检查。"

#: includes/admin/trait-media.php:360
msgid "No image has a WebP or AVIF copy yet, so there is nothing to check."
msgstr "还没有图片拥有 WebP 或 AVIF 副本，因此没有可检查的内容。"

