#, php-format
msgid "%1$s (%2$s%%)"
msgstr "%1$s（%2$s %%）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1107
msgid "Critical CSS is a Pro feature."
msgstr "关键 CSS 是 Pro 功能。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1124
msgid "Critical CSS deleted. The site is serving its stylesheets exactly as before."
msgstr "关键 CSS 已删除。站点提供样式表的方式与之前完全一致。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1134
msgid "Critical CSS is now being inlined."
msgstr "关键 CSS 现已内联。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1135
msgid "Critical CSS is stored but no longer inlined."
msgstr "关键 CSS 已保存，但不再内联。"

#. translators: %s: number of templates that failed.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1153
#, php-format
msgid "Generated, with %s template(s) that could not be read. Check the table before applying."
msgstr "已生成，其中 %s 个模板无法读取。应用前请检查表格。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1156
msgid "Generated. Nothing has changed for visitors yet — review the sizes and the preview, then apply."
msgstr "已生成。访客看到的内容尚未改变——查看大小与预览后再应用。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1192
msgid "Delay JavaScript until the first interaction"
msgstr "延迟 JavaScript 到首次交互"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1193
msgid "Holds scripts back until the visitor moves, taps, scrolls or types — the single biggest improvement to responsiveness, because that work leaves the load path entirely. Off by default, and conservative when on."
msgstr "在访客移动、触摸、滚动或输入之前一直扣住脚本——对响应速度提升最大的一项，因为这部分工作完全离开了加载路径。默认关闭，开启后也保持保守。"

#. translators: %s: detected asset-optimizer plugin name.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1201
#, php-format
msgid "Another asset optimizer is active (%s). Delaying stays off: two plugins rewriting the same script tags is how a site ends up with scripts that never run."
msgstr "已有另一个资源优化插件在运行（%s）。延迟保持关闭：两个插件改写同一批脚本标签，正是站点出现脚本永不执行的原因。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1210
msgid "Delaying JavaScript until the first interaction is a Pro feature."
msgstr "延迟 JavaScript 到首次交互是 Pro 功能。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1225
msgid "What to delay"
msgstr "延迟哪些"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1229
msgid "Known third parties only (recommended)"
msgstr "仅限已知第三方（推荐）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1230
msgid "Analytics, tag managers, pixels, chat widgets and social embeds. Your theme and plugins keep running exactly as they do now, so nothing that renders the page is affected."
msgstr "分析统计、代码管理器、像素、聊天挂件和社交嵌入。你的主题和插件与现在完全一样地运行，绘制页面的部分不受影响。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1235
msgid "Every script except the exclusions"
msgstr "除排除项外的所有脚本"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1236
msgid "Faster, and the option that can break things: a slider, a menu or a cart that needs its script to run before the visitor touches anything will look broken until they do. Test the site before leaving this on."
msgstr "更快，也是可能弄坏东西的选项：轮播、菜单或购物车如果需要在访客操作前就运行脚本，在那之前都会像是坏了。保持开启前请先测试站点。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1242
msgid "Run anyway after"
msgstr "无论如何在此秒数后执行"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1244
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "秒"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1245
msgid "The safety timer. Without it a visit that never interacts would never load analytics, and every bounce would go uncounted — which is how a site owner stops trusting their numbers."
msgstr "安全定时器。没有它，没有任何交互的访问就永远不会加载分析统计，每一次跳出都不会被计入——站点所有者正是这样开始不再相信自己的数据。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1249
msgid "jQuery"
msgstr "jQuery"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1250
msgid "WooCommerce cart and checkout"
msgstr "WooCommerce 购物车和结账"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1251
msgid "Elementor"
msgstr "Elementor"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1252
msgid "Other page builders (Avada, Divi, Bricks, Oxygen, Breakdance)"
msgstr "其他页面构建器（Avada、Divi、Bricks、Oxygen、Breakdance）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1253
msgid "Sliders and carousels"
msgstr "滑块和轮播"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1254
msgid "Maps"
msgstr "地图"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1255
msgid "Forms"
msgstr "表单"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1262
msgid "Never delay these kinds of script"
msgstr "永不延迟这些类型的脚本"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1271
msgid "The usual suspects when something stops working after delaying \"all scripts\": tick the ones your site uses."
msgstr "延迟“所有脚本”后出问题时的常见元凶：勾选你的网站使用的那些。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1272
msgid "Never delay these (one handle or URL fragment per line)"
msgstr "绝不延迟这些（每行一个句柄或网址片段）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1275
msgid "Also delay these (one handle or URL fragment per line)"
msgstr "同时延迟这些（每行一个句柄或网址片段）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1276
msgid "Adds to the recommended profile without switching to the aggressive one."
msgstr "在不切换到激进模式的前提下扩充推荐配置。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1279
msgid "Never delayed, whatever is set above: consent and cookie banners, payment providers and captchas. Delaying a consent banner is a compliance problem, not a speed one, and a delayed payment or captcha script fails silently — the form looks fine and submits nothing."
msgstr "无论上面怎么设置都绝不延迟：同意与 Cookie 横幅、支付服务商和验证码。延迟同意横幅是合规问题而不是速度问题，而被延迟的支付或验证码脚本会悄无声息地失败——表单看起来正常，却什么也没提交。"

#. translators: %s: a link to the current site with the bypass parameter.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1284
#, php-format
msgid "To compare both versions of a page, add %s to any URL: that request loads every script immediately, without changing this setting."
msgstr "要对比页面的两个版本，在任意网址后加上 %s：该请求会立即加载全部脚本，且不改动此设置。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1293
msgid "Save delay settings"
msgstr "保存延迟设置"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1315
msgid "Delaying JavaScript is a Pro feature."
msgstr "延迟 JavaScript 是 Pro 功能。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1337
msgid "Delay settings saved."
msgstr "延迟设置已保存。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1376
msgid "Minification settings saved."
msgstr "压缩设置已保存。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1391
msgid "Run a one-off, consented test that measures exactly where the server time goes — boot, plugin loading, routing, database and render. It does NOT affect your site in normal operation: nothing runs until you start a test, and it stops on its own after a few requests."
msgstr "运行一次性的、经你同意的测试，精确测量服务器时间花在哪里：启动、插件加载、路由、数据库和渲染。在正常运行时它不会影响你的网站：在你启动测试之前不会运行任何内容，并会在若干请求后自动停止。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1412
msgid "Run diagnostic test"
msgstr "运行诊断测试"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1413
msgid "The deep analysis test profiles your requests to pinpoint the exact culprit. The TTFB diagnosis, levers and trend above stay free."
msgstr "深度分析测试会对你的请求进行剖析，以精确定位罪魁祸首。上方的 TTFB 诊断、优化手段和趋势仍然免费。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1419
msgid "Run profiling test"
msgstr "运行性能分析测试"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1424
msgid "Profiles the next few front-end requests, then disarms automatically."
msgstr "分析接下来的若干前端请求，然后自动解除。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1443
msgid "Diagnostic report"
msgstr "诊断报告"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1444
msgid "The detailed breakdown of your last profiling test: where the server time went, which hooks and plugins cost the most, and what to do about it."
msgstr "上次诊断测试的详细分解：服务器时间花在哪里、哪些钩子和插件开销最大，以及该怎么办。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1453
msgid "No profiling report yet. Run a diagnostic test from the assistant and it will appear here."
msgstr "尚无诊断报告。在助手中运行一次诊断测试，报告即会显示在此。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1456
msgid "Back to the assistant"
msgstr "返回助手"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1464
msgid "Boot — loading PHP, WordPress and plugins"
msgstr "启动 — 加载 PHP、WordPress 和插件"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1465
msgid "Plugin startup (init) — plugins set themselves up"
msgstr "插件启动（init）— 插件进行自身初始化"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1466
msgid "Everything loaded (wp_loaded)"
msgstr "全部加载完成（wp_loaded）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1467
msgid "Routing — choosing the page"
msgstr "路由 — 选择页面"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1468
msgid "Main query — fetching the content"
msgstr "主查询 — 获取内容"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1469
msgid "Render — building and sending the page"
msgstr "渲染 — 构建并发送页面"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1474
msgid "Most of the time is spent just loading WordPress and the active plugins — usually a sign of too many or very heavy plugins."
msgstr "大部分时间仅花在加载 WordPress 和已启用的插件上——通常说明插件过多或过于沉重。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1475
msgid "Most of the time is spent while plugins start up on every page load (the WordPress init step). The list below shows what ran and when — if the biggest entry is named after a plugin, that is the one to look at."
msgstr "大部分时间花在插件于每次页面加载时进行初始化的过程中（WordPress 的 init 步骤）。下面的列表显示了运行了什么以及何时运行——如果最大的一项以某个插件命名，那就是该看的那个。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1476
msgid "Most of the time is spent right after everything loaded — see the list below to find which hook is responsible."
msgstr "大部分时间花在全部加载完成之后——请查看下方列表找出是哪个钩子导致的。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1477
msgid "Most of the time is spent working out which page this is — permalink rules, redirects and anything hooked into routing."
msgstr "大部分时间花在判断这是哪个页面上：固定链接规则、重定向，以及任何挂到路由上的东西。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1478
msgid "Most of the time is spent on the query that fetches the content of this page — often slow queries or a plugin filtering them."
msgstr "大部分时间花在获取本页内容的查询上——通常是慢查询，或者某个插件在过滤它们。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1479
msgid "Most of the time is spent building and sending the page itself — this is the theme and, if you use one, the page builder."
msgstr "大部分时间花在构建并发送页面本身上：这就是主题，以及你若使用了页面构建器的话，还有它。"

#. translators: 1: measured TTFB in ms, 2: number of profiled requests, 3: relative time (e.g. "2 minutes").
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1506
#, php-format
msgid "Slowest of the last %2$d profiled requests: %1$d ms · captured %3$s ago."
msgstr "最近 %2$d 次分析请求中最慢的一次：%1$d 毫秒 · 于 %3$s前捕获。"

#. translators: 1: number of samples, 2: median ms, 3: 95th percentile ms, 4: fastest ms, 5: slowest ms.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1519
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d samples · median %2$d ms · p95 %3$d ms · range %4$d–%5$d ms."
msgstr "%1$d 次采样 · 中位数 %2$d ms · p95 %3$d ms · 区间 %4$d–%5$d ms。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1528
msgid "One sample, so there is no spread to judge yet — run the test again to see whether this is typical."
msgstr "只有一次采样，还判断不出波动范围——再跑一次测试，看看这是否具有代表性。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1538
msgid "The object cache was COLD for this request: it had to be filled from the database. A warm request is considerably faster."
msgstr "这次请求的对象缓存是冷的：它必须从数据库填充。缓存热起来之后的请求要快得多。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1539
msgid "The object cache was warm for this request."
msgstr "这次请求的对象缓存是热的。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1544
msgid "a visit that runs WP-Cron is much slower than one that does not"
msgstr "触发 WP-Cron 的访问比未触发的慢得多"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1545
msgid "a request that misses the object cache is much slower than one that hits it"
msgstr "未命中对象缓存的请求比命中的慢得多"

#. translators: %s: why one profiled request is slower than another.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1548
#, php-format
msgid "This is one real request from the test. The TTFB shown in the Performance assistant above is instead a rolling average of recent visits, so the two numbers differ — front-end TTFB swings request to request (%s)."
msgstr "这是测试中的一次真实请求。而上方性能助手显示的 TTFB 是近期访问的滑动平均值，因此两个数字不同——前端 TTFB 会因请求而异（%s）。"

#. translators: %s: plain-language description of a WordPress internal step.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1607
#, php-format
msgid "Here it is not one plugin: the biggest single step is WordPress itself (%s), which every plugin on the site shares."
msgstr "这里没有哪个插件该负责：最大的单个步骤是 WordPress 本身（%s），站点上所有插件都共用它。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1621
msgid "Where the time went (top hooks)"
msgstr "时间都花在哪了（主要钩子）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1647
msgid "first use — warms up after this"
msgstr "首次使用——之后就热了"

#. translators: %s: plugin or theme name that triggered the hook.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1657
#, php-format
msgid "fired by %s"
msgstr "由 %s 触发"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1664
msgid "These are the actions/filters that consumed the most server time, each with the stage it ran in — they do not all belong to the biggest bar above. A hook named after a plugin (e.g. woocommerce_, elementor/) points straight at that plugin; a slow generic hook means several plugins share the cost."
msgstr "这些是消耗服务器时间最多的动作/过滤器，每一项都标注了它所处的阶段——它们并不都属于上面最大的那根柱子。以插件命名的钩子（例如 woocommerce_、elementor/）直接指向该插件；一个缓慢的通用钩子则意味着多个插件在分摊这份开销。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1670
msgid "Database this request"
msgstr "本次请求的数据库"

#. translators: 1: number of queries, 2: total query time in ms, 3: slow query count.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1673
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d queries · %2$d ms · %3$d slow (>50 ms)"
msgstr "%1$d 次查询 · %2$d 毫秒 · %3$d 次慢查询（>50 毫秒）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1680
msgid "Most repeated queries by source (plugin/theme):"
msgstr "按来源（插件/主题）最常重复的查询："

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1723
msgid "Full table scan with no usable index"
msgstr "全表扫描，没有可用的索引"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1724
msgid "Full table scan"
msgstr "全表扫描"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1725
msgid "Sorting rows without an index (filesort)"
msgstr "在没有索引的情况下排序（filesort）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1726
msgid "Building a temporary table"
msgstr "创建临时表"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1728
msgid "Slow queries that may be missing an index"
msgstr "可能缺少索引的慢查询"

#. translators: 1: rows scanned (formatted), 2: query time in ms.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1738
#, php-format
msgid "(~%1$s rows scanned · %2$d ms)"
msgstr "（扫描约 %1$s 行 · %2$d 毫秒）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1749
msgid "Suggested index:"
msgstr "建议的索引："

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1751
msgid "Create this index now? On a large table it can take a while and load the database meanwhile. You can remove it afterwards."
msgstr "现在创建此索引吗？对大表来说可能需要一些时间，并在此期间增加数据库负载。之后可以删除它。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1756
msgid "Apply index"
msgstr "应用索引"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1763
msgid "These SELECTs scanned a large table without a usable index. Adding the suggested index usually makes them much faster. WPOptimizing only creates one when you press its button and confirm, and you can remove it again below; on a large table it can take a while and load the database meanwhile, so do it at a quiet time. Queries with a compound or range condition are listed without a suggestion because the right index depends on the exact query."
msgstr "这些 SELECT 查询在没有可用索引的情况下扫描了一个大表。添加建议的索引通常能让它们快很多。只有在你点击按钮并确认后，WPOptimizing 才会创建索引，并且你可以在下方再次删除；对大表来说可能需要一些时间并增加数据库负载，请在空闲时进行。带有复合或范围条件的查询没有给出建议，因为合适的索引取决于具体查询。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1765
msgid "Pro can create a suggested index for you with one click (and undo it just as easily)."
msgstr "Pro可一键为您创建建议的索引（并同样轻松地撤销）。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1785
msgid "Indexes WPOptimizing created"
msgstr "WPOptimizing 创建的索引"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1793
msgid "on"
msgstr "在"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1795
msgid "Remove this index?"
msgstr "移除该索引？"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1821
msgid "What to do about it"
msgstr "该怎么办"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1823
msgid "Nothing stands out: the server response time is healthy. The remaining time is your server/hosting (PHP version, OPcache, resources), which WPOptimizing cannot change."
msgstr "没有突出问题：服务器响应时间良好。其余时间属于你的服务器/主机（PHP 版本、OPcache、资源），这是 WPOptimizing 无法改变的。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1838
msgid "Anything left after these is your server/hosting (PHP version, OPcache, hosting resources, a light theme), which WPOptimizing cannot change."
msgstr "在这些之后剩下的时间属于你的服务器/主机（PHP 版本、OPcache、主机资源、轻量主题），这是 WPOptimizing 无法改变的。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1860
msgid "cold object cache or a visit that ran WP-Cron"
msgstr "对象缓存未预热，或某次访问触发了 WP-Cron"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1861
msgid "cold object cache"
msgstr "对象缓存未预热"

#. translators: %d: milliseconds spent loading translations.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1935
#, php-format
msgid "Translation loading (~%d ms)"
msgstr "加载翻译（约 %d 毫秒）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1937
msgid "Plugins translate their text on every page load. Keep WordPress and your plugins up to date (6.5+ caches translations), and remove language files for locales you do not use."
msgstr "插件在每次页面加载时翻译其文本。请保持 WordPress 和插件更新（6.5+ 会缓存翻译），并删除你不使用的语言文件。"

#. translators: 1: milliseconds, 2: human-readable autoload size.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1956
#, php-format
msgid "Loading the options table (~%1$d ms this request)"
msgstr "加载选项表（本次请求约 %1$d 毫秒）"

#. translators: 1: human-readable autoload size, 2: likely cause of the one-off slow request.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1960
#, php-format
msgid "Your autoload payload is already healthy (%1$s), so this is a slow one-off request (%2$s), not a size problem. Typical requests are much faster; no action needed."
msgstr "你的自动加载体量已很健康（%1$s），所以这只是一次偶发的慢请求（%2$s），并非体量问题。正常请求要快得多，无需处理。"

#. translators: %d: milliseconds spent loading the options table.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1972
#, php-format
msgid "Loading the options table (~%d ms)"
msgstr "加载选项表（约 %d 毫秒）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1974
msgid "Too many autoloaded options are read on every request. Trim them from the Autoload tab (Smart Deactivation is reversible)."
msgstr "每次请求都读取了过多的 autoload 选项。请在 Autoload 选项卡中精简它们（智能停用可撤销）。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1978
msgid "Open Autoload"
msgstr "打开 Autoload"

#. translators: %d: milliseconds spent looking up options that are not stored.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1994
#, php-format
msgid "Options that do not exist (~%d ms)"
msgstr "不存在的选项（~%d ms）"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated option names.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:1997
#, php-format
msgid "These options are asked for on every request but are not stored, so each lookup returns nothing: %s. This is the plugin that owns them falling back to a default, not a fault of your site — it is worth reporting to its author."
msgstr "这些选项在每次请求时都会被查询，但并未存储，因此每次查找都返回空：%s。这是拥有它们的插件回退到了默认值，并不是你站点的故障——值得反馈给它的作者。"

#. translators: 1: theme name, 2: milliseconds.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2023
#, php-format
msgid "Your theme %1$s is doing heavy work (~%2$d ms)"
msgstr "你的主题 %1$s 正在进行繁重的工作（~%2$d 毫秒）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2024
msgid "The active theme runs real work on every page load. You cannot deactivate the active theme, but a lighter one would cut this — or review the theme / page-builder options and switch off elements and features you do not use."
msgstr "当前主题在每次页面加载时都会执行实际工作。你无法停用当前主题，但更轻量的主题能减少这一点——或检查主题/页面构建器的选项，关闭你不使用的元素和功能。"

#. translators: 1: plugin name, 2: milliseconds.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2035
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s is doing heavy work (~%2$d ms)"
msgstr "%1$s 正在做繁重的工作（~%2$d ms）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2036
msgid "Your site depends on this one, so switching it off is not an option — but it rarely needs everything it loads. Check its own settings for features you do not use, and stop its CSS and JavaScript loading on the pages that do not need them from the Smart Assets tab."
msgstr "你的站点依赖它，关闭并不是选项——但它很少需要自己加载的全部内容。在它自己的设置里看看有没有你不用的功能，并在 Smart Assets 标签页里让它的 CSS 和 JavaScript 不要加载到不需要的页面上。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2038
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2156
msgid "Open Smart Assets"
msgstr "打开 Smart Assets"

#. translators: 1: plugin name, 2: milliseconds.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2044
#, php-format
msgid "The plugin %1$s is doing heavy work (~%2$d ms)"
msgstr "插件 %1$s 正在进行繁重的工作（~%2$d 毫秒）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2045
msgid "This plugin spends real time on every page load. Deactivate it if you no longer need it, or look for a lighter alternative."
msgstr "该插件在每次页面加载时都消耗实际时间。若不再需要请停用它，或寻找更轻量的替代方案。"

#. translators: 1: number of queries, 2: total query time in ms.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2063
#, php-format
msgid "Database queries (%1$d queries · %2$d ms this request)"
msgstr "数据库查询（%1$d 条查询 · 本次请求 %2$d 毫秒）"

#. translators: %s: likely cause of the outlier request.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2066
#, php-format
msgid "A persistent object cache is already active, so these are uncached queries on this specific request (often a %s outlier). If the query time stays high across requests, the heaviest plugin listed above is the place to look."
msgstr "持久对象缓存已启用，因此这些是本次特定请求中未缓存的查询（通常是%s导致的离群值）。若查询时间在所有请求中都居高不下，请查看上面列表中开销最大的插件。"

#. translators: 1: number of queries, 2: total query time in ms.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2076
#, php-format
msgid "Database queries (%1$d queries · %2$d ms)"
msgstr "数据库查询（%1$d 次查询 · %2$d 毫秒）"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2077
msgid "A persistent object cache keeps expensive queries in memory and is the single biggest server-TTFB win. Enable it from the Cache tab."
msgstr "持久对象缓存将昂贵的查询保留在内存中，是提升服务器 TTFB 的最大手段。请在缓存选项卡中启用它。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2079
msgid "Open Cache"
msgstr "打开缓存"

#. translators: 1: asset handle, 2: human-readable size.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2139
#, php-format
msgid "One file accounts for most of your CSS and JavaScript: %1$s (%2$s)"
msgstr "一个文件就占了你大部分的 CSS 和 JavaScript：%1$s（%2$s）"

#. translators: %s: human-readable total size.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2145
#, php-format
msgid "Your pages ship %s of CSS and JavaScript"
msgstr "你的页面会发送 %s 的 CSS 和 JavaScript"

#. translators: 1: CSS size, 2: JS size, 3: number of assets measured.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2150
#, php-format
msgid "Measured across the %3$d assets this site enqueues: %1$s of CSS and %2$s of JavaScript. Every visitor downloads this before the page can finish. The biggest win is usually not making the files smaller but not sending them where they are not used — Smart Assets shows which plugin owns each one and lets you unload it per page."
msgstr "基于本站点加入队列的 %3$d 个资源测得：CSS %1$s，JavaScript %2$s。每位访客都要先下载这些，页面才能完成。最大的收益通常不是把文件变小，而是不要把它们发送到用不到的地方——Smart Assets 会显示每个文件属于哪个插件，并允许你按页面卸载它。"

#. translators: 1: number of images, 2: total images on the page.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2187
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d of the %2$d images on your home page have no width and height"
msgstr "首页 %2$d 张图片中有 %1$d 张没有设置宽度和高度"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2191
msgid "Without those two attributes the browser cannot reserve the space, so everything below each image jumps down when it finally arrives. This is what Core Web Vitals measures as layout shift, and it is the single most irritating thing a page can do to a reader. Turn on content image optimization below, and for images printed by the theme rather than by the content, ask its author — or replace them with images from the media library, which carry their size."
msgstr "缺少这两个属性，浏览器就无法预留空间，于是每张图片下方的内容都会在图片终于加载出来时向下跳动。这正是 Core Web Vitals 所衡量的布局偏移，也是一个页面能对读者做的最恼人的事。请在下方开启内容图片优化；对于由主题而非内容输出的图片，请咨询主题作者——或者改用媒体库中的图片，它们自带尺寸信息。"

#. translators: 1: number of images, 2: total images on the page.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2200
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d of the %2$d images on your home page load immediately"
msgstr "首页 %2$d 张图片中有 %1$d 张会立即加载"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2204
msgid "Images the visitor has not scrolled to yet are competing for bandwidth with the ones they can already see, so the visible part of the page finishes later than it needs to. Content image optimization adds the deferral automatically and leaves the first image eager, which is the one that should load first."
msgstr "访客还没有滚动到的图片，正在与他们已经看得见的图片争抢带宽，于是页面可见部分的加载比实际需要的更晚完成。内容图片优化会自动添加延迟加载，并让第一张图片保持立即加载——那正是应当最先到达的一张。"

#. translators: 1: number of images, 2: total images on the page.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2213
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d of the %2$d images on your home page offer only one size"
msgstr "首页 %2$d 张图片中有 %1$d 张只提供一种尺寸"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2217
msgid "With no list of alternative sizes, a phone downloads the same file a desktop does — often several times larger than its screen can show. Images inserted from the media library get that list from WordPress automatically; ones hard-coded in a template or pasted as raw HTML do not."
msgstr "没有备选尺寸列表时，手机会下载与桌面端完全相同的文件——往往比屏幕能显示的大好几倍。从媒体库插入的图片会自动从 WordPress 获得这个列表；而写死在模板里或以原始 HTML 粘贴的图片则不会。"

#. translators: %d: number of HTML elements.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2226
#, php-format
msgid "Your home page is built from %d HTML elements"
msgstr "你的首页由 %d 个 HTML 元素构成"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2229
msgid "Past roughly 1,400 elements the browser spends real time on style and layout for every change on the page, and past 2,500 it is the dominant cost — whatever the server does. The usual cause is a page builder nesting rows inside columns inside containers, or a very long archive. Showing fewer items per page, or flattening the sections you build most often, does more here than any server-side setting."
msgstr "超过大约 1,400 个元素后，页面每次变化都会让浏览器在样式和布局上花费实实在在的时间；超过 2,500 个后，无论服务器多快，这都会成为主要开销。常见原因是页面构建器把行嵌进列、再嵌进容器，或者归档页过长。减少每页显示的条目数，或把你最常搭建的区块结构扁平化，比任何服务器端设置都更有效。"

#. translators: %d: number of elements carrying a style attribute.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2238
#, php-format
msgid "%d elements on your home page carry their own inline styles"
msgstr "首页有 %d 个元素带有各自的内联样式"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2241
msgid "A style attribute cannot be cached, minified or reused between pages: it is re-sent in full with every request. At this volume a builder is writing a stylesheet one element at a time. Check whether it offers a “load CSS as a file” or “combine styles” option — that alone moves the weight into something the browser can cache."
msgstr "style 属性无法缓存、无法压缩，也无法在页面之间复用：每次请求都要完整重新传输。达到这个数量，说明构建器正在逐个元素地写样式表。请检查它是否提供「将 CSS 作为文件加载」或「合并样式」的选项——仅此一项就能把这部分重量转移到浏览器可以缓存的地方。"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2254
msgid "Open front-end settings"
msgstr "打开前端设置"

#. translators: 1: percentage of the request, 2: hook name or plain-language label.
#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:2290
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d%% of this request went into one thing: %2$s"
