msgstr "最大 28，以确保与所有月份兼容。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:739
msgid "When enabled, WordPress cron will run the General cleanup automatically."
msgstr "启用后，WordPress Cron 将自动运行常规清理。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:746
