msgstr "优化数据表"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:757
msgid "Every run"
msgstr "每次运行"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:765
msgid "Optionally run some tasks less often than the main schedule. “Every run” follows the schedule above; “Never” skips the task on automatic runs (manual runs always run every enabled task)."
msgstr "可选择让某些任务的执行频率低于主计划。“每次运行”遵循上面的计划；“从不”会在自动运行时跳过该任务（手动运行始终执行所有已启用的任务）。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:780
msgid "Run the General cleanup automatically once the database grows by more than this many MB since the last cleanup. 0 disables it."
msgstr "当数据库自上次清理以来增长超过这么多 MB 时，自动运行常规清理。设为 0 可禁用。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:791
msgid "Speculative loading, image loading, preload, lazy embeds, resource hints, Google Fonts, CDN and Server-Timing are now under Speed › Page & browser, next to minify, delay JavaScript and critical CSS."
msgstr "推测加载、图片加载、预加载、延迟嵌入、资源提示、Google Fonts、CDN 和 Server-Timing 现在位于「速度 › 页面与浏览器」，与压缩、延迟 JavaScript 和关键 CSS 放在一起。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:811
msgid "Open Speed › Page & browser"
msgstr "打开 速度 › 页面与浏览器"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:819
msgid "Turn off WordPress features you do not use to trim front-end weight and head/feed noise. Every option is off by default and fully reversible — nothing is deleted."
msgstr "关闭你用不到的 WordPress 功能，以减轻前端体积并减少页头与订阅源中的杂项。每个选项默认关闭且完全可逆——不会删除任何内容。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:862
msgid "Branding"
msgstr "品牌标识"

#. translators: %s: active brand name.
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:871
#, php-format
msgid "White-label is managed from your account for this license (active brand: %s) and applies automatically to every activation."
msgstr "白标由你账户中此许可证管理（当前品牌：%s），并自动应用于每次激活。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:895
msgid "Send a signed JSON POST to an external URL when WPOptimizing finishes a scan, a cleanup, a deletion or a dataset upload (e.g. Slack, Zapier, n8n or your own endpoint)."
msgstr "当 WPOptimizing 完成扫描、清理、删除或数据集上传时，向外部网址发送签名的 JSON POST 请求（例如 Slack、Zapier、n8n 或你自己的端点）。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:906
msgid "Leave empty to disable webhooks."
msgstr "留空以禁用 webhooks。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:911
msgid "Optional. When set, each request carries an X-WPOptimizing-Signature header (HMAC-SHA256 of the body) so the receiver can verify authenticity."
msgstr "可选。设置后，每个请求都会携带 X-WPOptimizing-Signature 头（请求体的 HMAC-SHA256），以便接收方验证真实性。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:926
msgid "Choose which events trigger the webhook. With none selected, all events are sent."
msgstr "选择触发 webhook 的事件。如未选择任何事件，则发送所有事件。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:938
msgid "Shared attribution dataset"
msgstr "共享归因数据集"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:946
msgid "WPOptimizing can contribute attribution metadata to a shared dataset that improves accuracy for everyone. Only names (of options, meta keys, tables and files), their sizes and how often they are seen are sent, together with your site’s domain, which authorises the exchange — never option values, post or user content, or any record contents. Sharing is opt-in and reciprocal: while it is off, the plugin keeps working with locally captured attribution but does not exchange data with the shared dataset."
msgstr "WPOptimizing 可以向共享数据集贡献归因元数据，从而为所有人提高准确性。仅发送名称（选项、元数据键、表和文件的名称）、它们的大小及其出现频率，以及用于授权交换的你的站点域名 — 绝不发送选项值、文章或用户内容或任何记录内容。共享需主动选择且为互惠：关闭时，插件会继续使用本地捕获的归因，但不会与共享数据集交换数据。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:951
msgid "Share attribution metadata to improve and receive the shared dataset."
msgstr "共享归因元数据以改进并接收共享数据集。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:953
msgid "You can turn this off at any time."
msgstr "你可以随时关闭它。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:954
msgid "See exactly what is shared and what is never sent:"
msgstr "查看究竟分享了什么，以及什么绝不会发送："

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:969
msgid "Up to date"
msgstr "最新"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:970
msgid "A few days old"
msgstr "已有几天"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:971
msgid "Outdated"
msgstr "已过时"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:972
msgid "Not downloaded yet"
msgstr "尚未下载"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:974
msgid "Knowledge base"
msgstr "知识库"

#. translators: %s: human-readable time-ago, e.g. "3 hours".
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:986
#, php-format
msgid "updated %s ago"
msgstr "%s前更新"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:999
msgid "Your local copy of each layer of the shared dataset. They refresh automatically every day; use \"Sync dataset now\" to update them immediately. A layer that stays on \"Not downloaded yet\" is not reaching your site — tell us if you see one."
msgstr "共享数据集中每一层在你站点上的本地副本。它们每天自动更新；点击「立即同步数据集」可立刻更新。若某一层始终显示「尚未下载」，说明它没有到达你的站点——看到的话请告诉我们。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1002
msgid "Sync now"
msgstr "立即同步"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1004
msgid "Uploads your contributions and refreshes your local copy of the shared dataset now, instead of waiting for the daily schedule. Save any sharing change first."
msgstr "立即上传你的贡献并刷新你本地的共享数据集副本，而不必等待每日计划。请先保存任何共享设置的更改。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1051 includes/maintenance-report.php:33
msgid "Off"
msgstr "关闭"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1052
msgid "Conservative (prefetch on click)"
msgstr "保守（点击时预取）"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1053
msgid "Eager (prerender on hover)"
msgstr "积极（悬停时预渲染）"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1058
msgid "Uses the browser Speculation Rules API to prefetch or prerender the next page on hover/click, so navigation feels instant. Admin, login, cart/checkout/account and URLs with a query string are excluded automatically."
msgstr "使用浏览器的 Speculation Rules API 在悬停/点击时预取或预渲染下一页，使导航感觉即时。后台、登录、购物车/结账/账户以及带查询字符串的 URL 会被自动排除。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1061
msgid "Optimize content image loading (prioritize the first image, lazy-load the rest)"
msgstr "优化内容图片加载（优先加载第一张图片，其余延迟加载）"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1062
msgid "Also outside the content — header, sidebars, footer — on pages saved by the page cache (the first three images stay eager)"
msgstr "也处理内容之外——页头、侧边栏、页脚——仅限页面缓存保存的页面（前三张图片立即加载）"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1065
msgid "Preload the featured image (likely LCP) on posts and pages so it starts downloading sooner"
msgstr "在文章和页面上预加载特色图片（可能的 LCP），使其更早开始下载"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1067
msgid "Also preload these URLs (one per line): above-the-fold fonts or a hero image"
msgstr "也预加载这些网址（每行一个）：首屏字体或主视觉图片"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1068
msgid "https://example.com/wp-content/themes/x/fonts/brand.woff2"
msgstr "https://example.com/wp-content/themes/x/fonts/brand.woff2"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1069
msgid "The right type (image, font, style, script) is detected from the file extension; fonts get crossorigin automatically. Only preload what is actually above the fold — preloading too much slows the page down."
msgstr "正确的类型（图片、字体、样式、脚本）会根据文件扩展名自动检测；字体会自动添加 crossorigin。只预加载真正位于首屏的资源——预加载过多会拖慢页面。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1072
msgid "Lazy-load iframes and replace YouTube embeds with a click-to-load thumbnail (loads the heavy player only on click)"
msgstr "延迟加载 iframe，并将 YouTube 嵌入替换为点击加载的缩略图（仅在点击时才加载沉重的播放器）"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1073
msgid "A YouTube embed pulls in about a megabyte of scripts before the visitor even presses play. The facade shows the video thumbnail and loads the real player (cookie-less youtube-nocookie.com) only when clicked — a big win for LCP and privacy. Stands down when a caching/optimization plugin already handles embeds."
msgstr "一个 YouTube 嵌入在访客还没点击播放之前，就会加载约一兆字节的脚本。外观占位会显示视频缩略图，仅在点击时才加载真正的播放器（无 Cookie 的 youtube-nocookie.com）——对 LCP 和隐私都是巨大的提升。当缓存/优化插件已处理嵌入时会自动停用。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1076
msgid "Send a Server-Timing header (DB queries, object-cache hit rate) for diagnostics"
msgstr "发送 Server-Timing 标头（数据库查询、对象缓存命中率）以便诊断"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1079
msgid "Add preconnect / dns-prefetch hints for the external origins the page loads (fonts, CDNs), so the browser connects sooner"
msgstr "为页面加载的外部来源（字体、CDN）添加 preconnect / dns-prefetch 提示，让浏览器更早建立连接"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1082
msgid "Self-host Google Fonts (serve the font CSS and files from this site, so the browser never contacts Google)"
msgstr "自托管 Google Fonts（从本站点提供字体 CSS 和文件，使浏览器永不联系 Google）"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1083
msgid "Removes the third-party connection to fonts.googleapis.com / fonts.gstatic.com (a common GDPR concern). Save with this on, then use \"Localize now\" below to download the fonts detected on your site."
msgstr "移除到 fonts.googleapis.com / fonts.gstatic.com 的第三方连接（常见的 GDPR 顾虑）。在启用此项的情况下保存，然后使用下方的「立即本地化」下载站点上检测到的字体。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1096
msgid "Serve static files (images, CSS, JS) from a CDN"
msgstr "从 CDN 提供静态文件（图片、CSS、JS）"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1099
msgid "Uploads (media library)"
msgstr "Uploads（媒体库）"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1100
msgid "wp-content (themes and plugins)"
msgstr "wp-content（主题和插件）"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1101
msgid "wp-includes (WordPress core assets)"
msgstr "wp-includes（WordPress 核心资源）"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1103
msgid "Enter the CDN hostname (no https://). URLs of local static files under the selected folders are rewritten to this host; dynamic PHP endpoints and external URLs are never touched. Point your CDN as a pull zone / origin at this site first, and make sure it serves fonts with the right CORS headers."
msgstr "输入 CDN 主机名（不含 https://）。所选文件夹下本地静态文件的 URL 会被重写到此主机；动态 PHP 端点和外部 URL 绝不会被触及。请先将你的 CDN 作为拉取区/源指向本站点，并确保它以正确的 CORS 响应头提供字体。"

#. translators: %s: the other plugin's name.
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1125
#, php-format
msgid "%s is already self-hosting Google Fonts, so WPOptimizing is standing aside to avoid conflicts. Disable it there if you want WPOptimizing to handle fonts instead."
msgstr "%s 已在自托管 Google Fonts，因此 WPOptimizing 会主动让位以避免冲突。如果你希望改由 WPOptimizing 处理字体，请在那里将其停用。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1145
msgid "No Google Fonts detected yet. Save with self-hosting on, open your site once so the fonts are detected, then return here and click \"Localize now\"."
msgstr "尚未检测到 Google Fonts。在启用自托管的情况下保存，打开你的站点一次以便检测到字体，然后返回此处并点击「立即本地化」。"

#. translators: 1: localized stylesheet count, 2: font file count, 3: pending count.
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1152
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d stylesheet(s) localized (%2$d font files); %3$d pending."
msgstr "已本地化 %1$d 个样式表（%2$d 个字体文件）；%3$d 个待处理。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1166
msgid "Local"
msgstr "本地"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1173
msgid "Localize now"
msgstr "立即本地化"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1175
msgid "Remove local fonts"
msgstr "移除本地字体"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1195
msgid "WPOptimizing — Downloading Google Fonts"
msgstr "WPOptimizing — 正在下载 Google Fonts"

#. translators: 1: stylesheets done, 2: stylesheets in total.
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1205
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s of %2$s stylesheets…"
msgstr "第 %1$s 个，共 %2$s 个样式表…"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1304
msgid "Compatibility with other plugins"
msgstr "与其他插件的兼容性"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1314
msgid "No other performance or optimization plugin was detected, so every WPOptimizing feature is free to run."
msgstr "未检测到其他性能或优化插件，因此 WPOptimizing 的所有功能都可以正常运行。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1320
msgid "These plugins are active and already provide some of what WPOptimizing does. Where doing it twice would fight, our version is switched off. Tick a row to run ours anyway."
msgstr "这些插件已启用，并且已经承担了 WPOptimizing 的部分工作。在重复执行会相互干扰的地方，我们的版本已关闭。勾选某一行可强制使用我们的版本。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1322
msgid "These plugins are active and already provide some of what WPOptimizing does. Where doing it twice would fight, our version is switched off — for delaying JavaScript and for critical CSS, doing it twice does not duplicate work, it breaks the page. Tick a row to run ours anyway."
msgstr "这些插件已启用，并且已经承担了 WPOptimizing 的部分工作。在重复执行会相互干扰的地方，我们的版本已关闭——延迟 JavaScript 和关键 CSS 做两遍不会加倍效果，而是会让页面出错。勾选某一行可强制使用我们的版本。"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated plugin names.
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1353
#, php-format
msgid "Also provided by %s. Both run: doing this twice is harmless, so WPOptimizing does not stand down and there is nothing to switch."
msgstr "%s 也提供此功能。两者并存：重复执行无害，因此 WPOptimizing 不会退让，也没有需要切换的选项。"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated plugin names.
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1367
#, php-format
msgid "Provided by %s."
msgstr "由 %s 提供。"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated plugin names.
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1392
#, php-format
msgid "WPOptimizing covers everything these plugins are used for, so you can manage it all from one place and deactivate them: %s. Check your settings here first."
msgstr "WPOptimizing 已涵盖这些插件的全部用途，你可以在一处统一管理并停用它们：%s。请先检查此处的设置。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1410
msgid "Settings sections"
msgstr "设置部分"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1447
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "保存更改"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1462
msgid "Import / export settings"
msgstr "导入 / 导出设置"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1472
msgid "Save this site’s configuration to a JSON file and restore it here or on another site — handy to replicate your setup across sites. It includes the settings for cleanup, scheduling, cache, media and images, Smart Assets, backups and attribution. Keys, passwords, the license, webhooks, data-sharing consent and measured runtime state (scan results, baselines, cached sizes) are never included."
msgstr "将本站点的配置保存为 JSON 文件，并在此处或其他站点恢复——便于在多个站点之间复制你的设置。它包含清理、计划、缓存、媒体和图片、Smart Assets、备份和归属的设置。密钥、密码、许可证、webhook、数据共享同意以及测得的运行时状态（扫描结果、基线、缓存大小）从不包含在内。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1482
msgid "Export"
msgstr "导出"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1484
msgid "Downloads a JSON file with the current configuration."
msgstr "下载包含当前配置的 JSON 文件。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1487
msgid "Import"
msgstr "导入"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1490
msgid "Select a file exported from WPOptimizing. Existing settings are overwritten; unknown keys are ignored."
msgstr "选择从 WPOptimizing 导出的文件。现有设置将被覆盖；未知的键将被忽略。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1558
msgid "No file was uploaded, or the upload failed."
msgstr "未上传任何文件，或上传失败。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1564
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1585
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1591
msgid "The uploaded file could not be read."
msgstr "无法读取上传的文件。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1579
msgid "The file is too large to be a settings export."
msgstr "该文件太大，不像是设置导出文件。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1602
msgid "The file is not valid JSON."
msgstr "该文件不是有效的 JSON。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1611
msgid "That file was not exported from WPOptimizing."
msgstr "该文件不是从 WPOptimizing 导出的。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1615
msgid "The file does not look like a WPOptimizing settings export."
msgstr "该文件看起来不像 WPOptimizing 的设置导出文件。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1619
msgid "Nothing was imported: the file had no recognized settings."
msgstr "未导入任何内容：文件中没有可识别的设置。"

#. translators: %d: number of settings groups imported.
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1644
#, php-format
msgid "%d settings group imported."
msgid_plural "%d settings groups imported."
msgstr[0] "已导入 %d 个设置组。"

#. translators: %d: number of unknown keys ignored.
#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1650
#, php-format
msgid "%d unknown entry was ignored."
msgid_plural "%d unknown entries were ignored."
msgstr[0] "已忽略 %d 个未知条目。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1688
msgid "No assets recorded yet. WPOptimizing samples public page loads in the background (sharing must be enabled); check back after some front-end visits."
msgstr "尚未记录任何资源。WPOptimizing 在后台对公开页面加载进行抽样（必须启用共享）；在若干前端访问后再来查看。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1698
msgid "Stop loading the ticked assets on the front-end (applies site-wide)"
msgstr "在前端不再加载勾选的资源（应用于整个站点）"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1699
msgid "Only disable assets you recognize, and test your site afterwards. WordPress core and jQuery are protected. Each change is saved and applied immediately, and is fully reversible: untick to restore."
msgstr "只停用你认识的资源，并在之后测试你的站点。WordPress 核心和 jQuery 受保护。每次更改都会立即保存并应用，且完全可撤销：取消勾选即可恢复。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1711
msgid "Automatically stop loading a plugin or theme's assets on pages where it is not used"
msgstr "在未使用某插件或主题的页面上自动停止加载其资源"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1712
msgid "Knowledge-base driven and context-aware: e.g. Contact Form 7 is dropped on pages with no form, WooCommerce off the shop/cart. Conservative (only well-known plugins), core/jQuery always protected, fully reversible. Test your key pages after enabling."
msgstr "由知识库驱动并感知上下文：例如在没有表单的页面上移除 Contact Form 7，在商店/购物车之外移除 WooCommerce。保守（仅限知名插件），核心/jQuery 始终受保护，完全可逆。启用后请测试你的关键页面。"

#: includes/admin/trait-settings.php:1718
msgid "Suggested by the knowledge base — automatic mode would drop these where they are not used:"
msgstr "由知识库建议——自动模式会在未使用它们的页面上将其卸载："

