msgstr "不经 PHP 直接提供"

#: includes/page-cache-static.php
msgid "The web server answers from the cached file directly, without starting PHP: faster pages and far more visitors at once on the same server. Only pages that need nothing from PHP are served this way (no separate mobile copy, currency, query string or security headers sent from PHP); the rest keep going through PHP as now."
msgstr "Web 服务器直接从缓存文件响应，无需启动 PHP：页面更快，同一台服务器可同时承载更多访客。只有不需要 PHP 处理的页面才会这样提供（没有单独的移动版副本、货币、查询字符串或由 PHP 发送的安全标头）；其余页面仍像现在一样经过 PHP。"

#: includes/page-cache-static.php
msgid "Serve cached pages straight from the web server (adds rules to .htaccess, backed up first)"
msgstr "直接由 Web 服务器提供缓存页面（向 .htaccess 添加规则，事先备份）"

#: includes/page-cache-static.php
msgid "This server does not read .htaccess (it is probably Nginx), so WordPress cannot add the rules itself. Whoever manages the server can add these lines to the site's configuration:"
